<title>UK: London sugar freight sees range of fixtures.</title>
<headline>London sugar freight sees range of fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSR fixed 30,000 bulk Queensland/China 1/15 July and Dreyfus 12,000 bagged Paranagua/Red Sea prompt Andre 13,000 bagged Immingham/E Med 19/27 June and 14,000 bulk N Brazil/Baltic, Black Sea or Med.</p>
<p>Mauritius Sugar Syndicate 14,000 bulk Port Louis/London early July about stg. 15.00.</p>
<p>New inquiry included Fiji Sugar Mktg 15,000 bulk Fiji/Japan 5/15 July CSR 20,000 bulk Queensland/Surabaya June/Jul Vitol 17,000 bulk Acajutla/Black Sea June.</p>
</text>
